"""Mutations of part 7d's actors (src/game/train.*, submarine.*, mp_zone.*, frame_volume.h and the
track player's accessors) for ../mutfast.py with the actors build:

    python mutfast.py mutations/mutate_7d.py --models DIR --build build_item.bat --check check_item.py

Each should make check_item.py fail (or the harness crash / hang). Left out as equivalent: the
crosshead's starting direction (a train's first wheel update has no chuff set, and both starts end
in the same state); LengthOf's / NormalizeBy's exact-1 and 1e-8-bit limits and an x sign test only
reached for x != 0; the wagon's saved w (the link into the sector makes it 1 again); a name of
exactly 127 bytes (the long path reads the same bytes); the heading without a previous point (it
only feeds the unused best: link 0 is taken); the previous point skipped (its dot is -1, below
0.5); the crossings' early return without a marked point (the loop from (uint32)-1 runs none);
the null-ahead check of Move (a null wagon returns one step earlier); the wheels' volume at exactly
1 and 10 km/h; ClearWagons' delete (a leak only); the submarine's slot -1 (the module has no sound
there), Reset's controls and unblocking (LeaveSeat of seat 0 / every seat does both), a null hull
box (GetChild never gives one), the normal's y (only x and z are used) and a climb of -0.0; the
zone's LengthOf limit (a radius of 0 or 1 meets no point there), the sphere's corner (min and max
are symmetric about the centre), SetFrame(null) (the base refuses it too), the strict box limits
(only points exactly on a face), the empty tie of a one-way zone and the held zone's return after
half time (both unreachable: an earlier return covers them); the frame volume's reset (a new
volume is zeroed) and null frame (the callers never pass one).

Results (2026-10-27): the first run caught 742 of 858 (one did not compile: an if's only
statement, now `;`); 89 of the 115 left needed new cases (frames turned and scaled, decoy rods and
box frames, tiny and zero facings, exact timers, slow tracks, a 1 ms move, the crossings alone,
LoadGame's skip and count-only chunks, a 55-degree path link, players just inside the sphere or out
of the box along one axis, randomised zone state, exact one-second checks, w components); 27
equivalent (dropped, above). All 831 caught."""
